DUKH PAYI HAI BHAI MAJAYI HAI BHAI..<br>
<br>
Dukh payi hai bhai majayi hai bhai,<br>
Chehlum tera karne ko behen ayi hai bhai.<br>
<br>
Aye bhai banane ko lahad aj tumhari,<br>
Taqdeer mujhe shaam se yaa'n layi hai bhai.<br>
<br>
Mai sadqe mere bekaso mazloom beradar,<br>
Kya bekasi lashe pe tere chayi hai bhai.<br>
<br>
Yeh jungle sunsan hai aur tum ho main qurbaan,<br>
Ab ap hai aur qabr ki tanhayi hai bhai.<br>
<br>
Rona na mila apke lashe pe behen ko,<br>
Matam tera karne ke liye aayi hai bhai.<br>
<br>
Kode the ilaaj e tape Sajjad safar me,<br>
Bimaar ne kya qoob dawa payi hai bhai.<br>
<br>
Darbaar me maiqaar ne jis waqt bulaya,<br>
Muh balon se dhape yeh behen aayi hai bhai.<br>
<br>
Mar margayi zindaa'n me bahen sharm ke maare,<br>
Jab Hind ke aane ki khabar payi hai bhai.<br>
<br>
Zinda me Sakina bhi huwi mout ke paale,<br>
Dafna ke bhatiji ki khabar layi hai bhai.<br>
<br>
'Baqar' pe tar ham ki nazar chahiye har dam,<br>
Zakir bhi hai aur apka shaidayi hai bhai..